(text "TEMPS GNSS : entree protegee et Schmitt, sorties vers Orin" (at 20.32 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "30615ba4-ae78-457d-8fa4-832974ae98dc"))
(text "REFERENCE ORIN : J509/1 = CSI22 VDD3.3\nJ509/2 = CSI GND1 ; retour requis pour isolation.\nGPIO/debug ne fournissent pas cette reference." (at 190.5 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)) (uuid "757283cc-1c94-4797-85d1-6b8abb8660ba"))
(text "AIRY : rail IO lie au 12V LiDAR et conversion RS232 candidate" (at 381 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "1100afcb-34fa-4c2c-896b-e6c652beeda4"))
(text "U510 EN ouvert : activation interne TPS709 ; NC4 ouvert.\nCeff LDO >=2.2uF ; pompe TRS : valeurs sous biais a confirmer." (at 398.78 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)) (uuid "464bfcf0-b6d1-49e3-8451-00881e85a5fa"))
(text "PPS + RMC GNSS : niveaux source, date et fronts a mesurer.\nR530-R533 DNP : banc requis avant raccordement cibles.\nRS232 Airy candidat exclusif ; adaptation TTL a revoir si besoin.\n3V3_SYNC/Orin/Airy : sequence, fuites et charges a qualifier.\nAucun ordre photo par PPS ; Jetson decide, PX4 declenche." (at 381 278.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "3b13ef65-e858-4f56-bed1-eb84b01fb389"))
(text "BROCHAGES FABRICANTS REPRESENTES ; CIRCUITS CANDIDATS / NON FABRICABLE" (at 20.32 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "ce96164c-ff58-4c85-b095-47fdc999af05"))
(text "05 - SYNCHRONISATION / CIRCUITS CANDIDATS - NON FABRICABLE" (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "720a5784-8ae3-446c-81a0-349d42980d05"))

